	measure 'Total Revenue Order Items' = ```
			
			VAR __MaxDate = CALCULATE(MAX(DIM_DATES[DATE]), ALLSELECTED(DIM_DATES[DATE]))
			RETURN
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM(FCT_ORDER_ITEMS[ITEM_TOTAL]),
			    KEEPFILTERS(DIM_DATES[DATE] <= __MaxDate)
			)
			
			```
		displayFolder: 00_Base\_Order Items
